  "details": "It would be amazing if the Vrchat Creator Companion had some of the following options, as at the moment when you have multiple projects it feels like a huge wall of text. \n- Split Avatars from Worlds.\n- The ability to favourite projects for quick access. \n- Last edit time (Just like in the Unity Hub).\n- Maybe even a way to add a tag to a project to sort projects, or a ways to group them. (Public worlds, Private worlds, Test projects etc).\n- A search feature.\nAttached an image as a rough example. \nThanks so much for all the work so far!",
